*> Acceptance test, US14 combat through the play path, second part (docs/protocol/17 sections 4.2, 4.3 and 4.8; Attack 0x01 in): sweeping
*> (a charged ground sword hit that is no crit and no sprint hit also hurts the other entities within 3 blocks of the target, 1.0 + the Sweeping Edge
*> ratio x the weapon damage), and the mace smash (the fall bonus is added to the base damage, unscaled). Alice (entity 1) at (20.5, 101, 20.5) facing
*> east, Bobby (entity 2) at 22.5, Carol (entity 3) at (23.5, 101, 20.5), a mob next to Bobby; all survival, standard item tables
*> (TEST-STANDARD-TABLES), enchantment rows from core/tests/fixtures/wire-registry (sweeping_edge is id 5).
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. ACC-US14-COMBAT-WIRE2.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY CORESTATE.
 COPY CTOOLS.
 COPY CMENU.
 COPY COREAPI.
 COPY CONTENT.
 COPY ETIDS.
 01 WS-NAME                PIC X(16).
 01 WS-NAME-LENGTH         BINARY-LONG VALUE 5.
 01 WS-ALICE               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BOB                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-CAROL               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RA                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RB                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-RC                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-BOB-ID              BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
 01 WS-SLOT                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOVE                BINARY-LONG VALUE 31.
 01 WS-FX                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 20.5.
 01 WS-FY                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 101.
 01 WS-FZ                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 20.5.
 01 WS-BX                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 22.5.
 01 WS-CX                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 23.5.
 01 WS-MX                  FLOAT-LONG VALUE 21.5.
 01 WS-YAW                 FLOAT-SHORT VALUE -90.
 01 WS-PITCH               FLOAT-SHORT VALUE 0.
 01 WS-FLAGS               BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-FLOOR-DIM           BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-FLOOR-X             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-FLOOR-Y             BINARY-LONG VALUE 100.
 01 WS-FLOOR-Z             BINARY-LONG VALUE 20.
 01 WS-FLOOR-STATE         BINARY-LONG VALUE 2.
 01 WS-TICKS               BINARY-LONG VALUE 12.
 01 WS-TEXT                PIC X(4096).
 01 WS-DIR                 PIC X(1100) VALUE "core/tests/fixtures/wire-registry".
 01 WS-STATUS              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-KEY                 PIC X(112).
 01 WS-ROW                 PIC X(270).
 01 WS-ITEM-ID             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SWORD               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MACE                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-HANDLE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ENCH                BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-LEVEL               BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOB-ROW             BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOB-TYPE            BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOB-HEALTH          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-MOB-ID              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DIM1                BINARY-LONG VALUE 1.
 01 WS-H1                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-H2                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-H3                  BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-SHIELD              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-AXE                 BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-DAMAGE              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-ACTION              BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-Z1                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-Z2                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-Z3                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-Z4                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-Z5                  BINARY-LONG VALUE 0.
 01 WS-ONE-TICKS          BINARY-LONG.
 01 WS-E1                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E2                  PIC -(9)9.
 01 WS-E3                  PIC -(9)9.
 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     CALL "TEST-SETTINGS" USING CORE-SETTINGS
     MOVE 0 TO CS-DEFAULT-MODE
     MOVE 2 TO CS-VIEW-DISTANCE
     MOVE 0 TO CS-HOSTILE-MOBS
     PERFORM OPEN-AND-JOIN

     MOVE "acceptance US14 sweeping: a charged ground iron_sword hit on Bobby also hurts Carol (1.0) and the mob next to him (1)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM PREP
     MOVE ET-SODGRAZER TO WS-MOB-TYPE
     CALL "MOB-SPAWN" USING WS-DIM1 WS-MOB-TYPE WS-MX WS-FY WS-FZ WS-YAW WS-MOB-ROW
     MOVE EN-HEALTH(WS-MOB-ROW) TO WS-MOB-HEALTH
     MOVE EN-ID(WS-MOB-ROW) TO WS-MOB-ID
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     COMPUTE WS-E3 = WS-MOB-HEALTH - EN-HEALTH(WS-MOB-ROW)
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " carol " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) " mob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1400 carol 1900 mob 1" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 Sweeping Edge 3 (registry row sweeping_edge, ratio 3/4) makes the sweep 1 + 0.75 x 6 = 5.5" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM PREP
     MOVE 5 TO WS-ENCH
     MOVE 3 TO WS-LEVEL
     MOVE 0 TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-ADD-ENCHANT" USING WS-HANDLE WS-ENCH WS-LEVEL
     MOVE WS-HANDLE TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RA, 1)
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " carol " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1400 carol 1450" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RA, 1)

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a critical hit does not sweep" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM PREP
     MOVE 0 TO PL-ON-GROUND(WS-RA)
     COMPUTE PL-FALL-START(WS-RA) = PL-Y(WS-RA) + 1
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " carol " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1100 carol 2000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE 1 TO PL-ON-GROUND(WS-RA)

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a sprint hit does not sweep" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM PREP
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SPRINTING(WS-RA)
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SPRINTING(WS-RA)
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " carol " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1400 carol 2000" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 a mace falling 2 blocks adds the smash bonus 4 x 2 = 8 to its 6: 14 damage, and the fall is reset" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE WS-MACE TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RA, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RA, 1)
     PERFORM PREP
     MOVE 0 TO PL-ON-GROUND(WS-RA)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SPRINTING(WS-RA)
     COMPUTE PL-FALL-START(WS-RA) = PL-Y(WS-RA) + 2
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     COMPUTE WS-E3 ROUNDED = PL-FALL-START(WS-RA) - PL-Y(WS-RA)
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " carol " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E2) " fall " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 600 carol 2000 fall 0" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE "acceptance US14 shield: Bobby raises a shield, 5 ticks later a sword hit from the front is blocked (health 20) and the shield loses 1 + 6 = 7" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE WS-SHIELD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RB, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-RB, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RB, 1)
     MOVE 90 TO PL-YAW(WS-RB)
     CALL "TEST-USE-ITEM" USING WS-BOB
     PERFORM TICKS-5
     PERFORM PREP
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     PERFORM SHIELD-DAMAGE
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " shield " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 2000 shield 7" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 shield: a hit from behind (Bobby faces away) is not blocked" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE -90 TO PL-YAW(WS-RB)
     PERFORM PREP
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1400" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE 90 TO PL-YAW(WS-RB)

     MOVE "acceptance US14 shield: after Player Action 6 (release) the shield is down and the hit lands" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 6 TO WS-ACTION
     CALL "TEST-ACTION" USING WS-BOB WS-ACTION WS-Z1 WS-Z2 WS-Z3 WS-Z4 WS-Z5
     PERFORM PREP
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1400" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 shield: a shield raised this very tick blocks nothing (the 5 tick delay)" TO TL-CASE
     CALL "TEST-USE-ITEM" USING WS-BOB
     PERFORM PREP
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1400" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 shield: an axe hit is blocked but disables the shield for 100 ticks; the next sword hit lands and Use Item cannot raise it" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM TICKS-5
     MOVE WS-AXE TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RA, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RA, 1)
     PERFORM PREP
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE WS-H1 TO WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RA, 1)
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(WS-RB)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-HURT-COOLDOWN(WS-RB)
     MOVE 0 TO TS-LAST-ATTACK(WS-RA)
     CALL "TEST-USE-ITEM" USING WS-BOB
     PERFORM TICKS-5
     MOVE 0 TO TS-LAST-ATTACK(WS-RA)
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE WS-DAMAGE TO WS-E3
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "axe hit " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) " then " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "axe hit 2000 then 1400" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK

     MOVE "acceptance US14 shield: an off-hand shield is raised by Use Item with an empty main hand and wears 7 on a blocked hit" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO TS-SHIELD-COOLDOWN(WS-RB)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-RB, 1)
     MOVE WS-SHIELD TO MN-EQUIP-ITEM(WS-RB, 5)
     MOVE 1 TO MN-EQUIP-COUNT(WS-RB, 5)
     MOVE 0 TO MN-EQUIP-VAR(WS-RB, 5)
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RA, 1)
     MOVE 6 TO WS-ACTION
     CALL "TEST-ACTION" USING WS-BOB WS-ACTION WS-Z1 WS-Z2 WS-Z3 WS-Z4 WS-Z5
     CALL "TEST-USE-ITEM" USING WS-BOB
     PERFORM TICKS-5
     PERFORM PREP
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE MN-EQUIP-VAR(WS-RB, 5) TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-GET-DAMAGE" USING WS-SHIELD WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-DAMAGE TO WS-E3
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) " offhand shield " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E3) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 2000 offhand shield 7" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     MOVE "acceptance US14 shield: a raised shield that is no longer in the hand blocks nothing and is let down" TO TL-CASE
     MOVE 0 TO MN-EQUIP-COUNT(WS-RB, 5)
     MOVE WS-SHIELD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RB, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-RB, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RB, 1)
     MOVE 6 TO WS-ACTION
     CALL "TEST-ACTION" USING WS-BOB WS-ACTION WS-Z1 WS-Z2 WS-Z3 WS-Z4 WS-Z5
     CALL "TEST-USE-ITEM" USING WS-BOB
     PERFORM TICKS-5
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RB, 1)
     PERFORM PREP
     CALL "TEST-ATTACK" USING WS-ALICE WS-BOB-ID
     PERFORM HEALTHS
     MOVE SPACES TO TL-OBSERVED
     STRING "bob " FUNCTION TRIM(WS-E1) DELIMITED BY SIZE INTO TL-OBSERVED
     MOVE "bob 1400" TO TL-EXPECTED
     PERFORM CHECK
     STOP RUN.

 TICKS-5.
     MOVE 5 TO WS-ONE-TICKS
     CALL "TEST-TICKS" USING WS-ONE-TICKS.

 SHIELD-DAMAGE.
     MOVE PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RB, 1) TO WS-HANDLE
     CALL "SP-GET-DAMAGE" USING WS-SHIELD WS-HANDLE WS-DAMAGE
     MOVE WS-DAMAGE TO WS-E3.

*> Both victims are healthy, out of any hurt window, and Alice's attack is charged.
 PREP.
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(WS-RB)
     MOVE 20 TO PL-HEALTH(WS-RC)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-HURT-COOLDOWN(WS-RB) PL-HURT-COOLDOWN(WS-RC)
     MOVE 0 TO TS-LAST-ATTACK(WS-RA)
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-BOB WS-TEXT
     CALL "TEST-DRAIN-HEALTH" USING WS-CAROL WS-TEXT.

*> The health of Bobby and Carol in hundredths: WS-E1 and WS-E2.
 HEALTHS.
     COMPUTE WS-H1 ROUNDED = PL-HEALTH(WS-RB) * 100
     COMPUTE WS-H2 ROUNDED = PL-HEALTH(WS-RC) * 100
     MOVE WS-H1 TO WS-E1
     MOVE WS-H2 TO WS-E2.

 OPEN-AND-JOIN.
     CALL "TEST-OPEN-WORLD" USING CORE-SETTINGS
     MOVE "Alice" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "TEST-JOIN" USING WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-ALICE
     MOVE "Bobby" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "TEST-JOIN" USING WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-BOB
     MOVE "Carol" TO WS-NAME
     CALL "TEST-JOIN" USING WS-NAME WS-NAME-LENGTH WS-CAROL
     MOVE CN-PLAYER(WS-ALICE) TO WS-RA
     MOVE CN-PLAYER(WS-BOB) TO WS-RB
     MOVE CN-PLAYER(WS-CAROL) TO WS-RC
     PERFORM VARYING WS-FLOOR-X FROM 20 BY 1 UNTIL WS-FLOOR-X > 25
         CALL "WORLD-SET-BLOCK" USING WS-FLOOR-DIM WS-FLOOR-X WS-FLOOR-Y WS-FLOOR-Z WS-FLOOR-STATE
     END-PERFORM
     CALL "TEST-MOVE" USING WS-ALICE WS-MOVE WS-FX WS-FY WS-FZ WS-YAW WS-PITCH WS-FLAGS
     CALL "TEST-MOVE" USING WS-BOB WS-MOVE WS-BX WS-FY WS-FZ WS-YAW WS-PITCH WS-FLAGS
     CALL "TEST-MOVE" USING WS-CAROL WS-MOVE WS-CX WS-FY WS-FZ WS-YAW WS-PITCH WS-FLAGS
     CALL "TEST-STANDARD-TABLES"
     CALL "REGISTRY-LOAD-ALL" USING WS-DIR WS-STATUS
     MOVE "iron_sword" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-SWORD WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "mace" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-MACE WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "shield" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-SHIELD WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE "iron_axe" TO WS-KEY
     CALL "CONTENT-ITEM-BY-KEY" USING WS-KEY WS-AXE WS-ROW WS-STATUS
     MOVE WS-SWORD TO PL-SLOT-ITEM(WS-RA, 1)
     MOVE 1 TO PL-SLOT-COUNT(WS-RA, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO PL-SLOT-VAR(WS-RA, 1)
     MOVE 0 TO WS-SLOT
     CALL "TEST-HELD" USING WS-ALICE WS-SLOT.

 CHECK.
     CALL "TEST-ASSERT" USING TESTLIB-ASSERT.
 END PROGRAM ACC-US14-COMBAT-WIRE2.

 COPY CORETEST.
